# E §10 a projection prints "the movements it counted with the clauses applied"; a balance "every movement since,
# with each movement's status and id".  L §5.14 Certainty: `with uncertain` on the read counts the unfulfilled
# movements of uncertain kinds dated through d at their planned amount: 1 000.00 + 500.00 = 1 500.00 PLN, in the
# projection (x1) and in the plain read that states it (x2); the promise is listed with status uncertain.
=== m.tally
model u
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source own "own"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind promises: event uncertain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2020-01-01..
place friend: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input owed: money PLN
input repay_day: date

move repay: promises
  on repay_day
  at repay_day
  leg cash from friend to konto amount owed

version v
  cite own
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  owed = 500.00 PLN "note"
  repay_day = 2026-03-01 governs always "note"
  opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "statement"

ask x1: explain bal(konto, 2026-04-01) from 2026-01-01 with uncertain
ask x2: explain bal(konto, 2026-04-01) with uncertain
=== expect
x1: 1 500.00 PLN
  projection of konto (PLN) from 2026-01-01 to the end of 2026-04-01
  holder: ask x1 (an ask line leaves out nothing, L §5.14.1)
  clauses: windows none, random none, with uncertain
  start: 1 000.00 PLN at the start of 2026-01-01
  counted:
    2026-03-01:
      repay.cash (uncertain): +500.00 PLN
  left out: none
  uncertain: repay
  held: owed = 500.00 PLN (v), read for 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-01-01
x2: 1 500.00 PLN
  balance of konto (PLN) at the end of 2026-04-01
  from: opening v:opening[konto] = 1 000.00 PLN, 2026-01-01 start (version v, source own, locator "statement")
  2026-03-01:
    repay.cash (uncertain): +500.00 PLN
  uncertain: repay
  held: owed = 500.00 PLN (v), read for 2026-03-01
  cut 2026-01-01
